    "body": "This regression is confirmed. The wheel mapping still exists, but the live trace shows the selected Psycho-mask proxy has no inventory count or clothing GUID. Its add path was limited to a new selection edge, so after the carrier disappeared the unchanged configured mask could never recreate it—even when the same mask was selected again at camp. Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#175 is reopened and actionable. I built a bounded recovery that waits for shops, inventory transactions, item interactions, and the wheel to be idle, then requires positive count and clothing-GUID readback. Installation is queued for the current RDR2 session to close.",
